      "name": "Smile Design Protocol",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "The 7-Point Smile Design Protocol",
        "heading": "Seven design decisions on every case.",
        "description": "Most snap-on veneer companies ship whatever comes off the line. Revive Veneers is designed against a seven-point protocol Dr. Turley developed in his cosmetic dental practice. Every case. If it doesn't pass, it doesn't ship.",
        "toggle_button_text": "Show all 7 steps →",
